  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSTRUCTION OF CAIR PLAZA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to generate continuous flow of income, which will be used on the CAIR&#x2019;s activities in the field of enhancement the understanding of Islam, encourage dialogue, protect civil liberties, empower American Muslims, and build coalitions that promote justice and mutual understanding etc. 



The purpose will be achieved through the construction of CAIR Plaza on a trust property owned by the Washington Trust Foundation (WTF), a subsidiary of CAIR. The plaza&#x2019;s commercial and residential space will be rented to generate a regular income for CAIR.</narrative>
  </description>
